Horizon port of More Industrial Foregoing Addons

Copyright (c) 2026 AdLf0208

This package is the Horizon port (`mifa`, mod API 0.2) of More Industrial
Foregoing Addons 2.1.0 by Christofmeg
(https://github.com/Christofmeg/MoreIndustrialForegoingAddons), and it carries
the upstream MIT licence above. The upstream jar
(`mifa-neoforge-1.21.x-2.1.0.jar`, SHA-256
dab09f72c4df39efc5d7f8949e4ab02b7d5f74242ee17b8c26fb172c2761d49f) ships no
LICENSE file: its `META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml` declares
`license = "The MIT License (MIT)"`, and the notice above is the upstream
repository's `LICENSE` at commit 5fc3ac843f03397f7a117152a081e42980ee2e52
(tag 2.1.0). The item names, model JSON and the recipe/tag data in this package
are a rewrite of that project's data for Minecraft 26.3 on Horizon; they are
distributed under the same MIT terms.
